1
00:00:01,000 --> 00:00:12,860
Slide 30 presents "THE DIGITAL MANDATE: Ethical Stewardship and Accountability in Agentic AI." Notice the three core ethical pillars that govern our laboratory.

2
00:00:13,760 --> 00:00:23,620
Directive 1: "Absolute Human Accountability — The human architect retains ultimate moral and legal responsibility for every action taken by their avatar."

3
00:00:24,520 --> 00:00:28,438
Directive 2: "Transparency by Design — No shadow decisions.

4
00:00:28,438 --> 00:00:36,540
Every automated step must be recorded in an inspectable, human-readable audit log with deterministic replay capabilities."

5
00:00:37,440 --> 00:00:47,450
Directive 3: "Human Flourishing — Systems must be engineered to alleviate burnout and restore peace, not accelerate digital anxiety and workplace surveillance."

6
00:00:48,350 --> 00:00:59,410
Under modern legal frameworks like the European Union AI Act, an engineer who deploys an unmonitored agent that spams customer databases or leaks private data cannot blame the AI model.

7
00:00:59,410 --> 00:01:02,460
Professional integrity demands sovereign oversight.

8
00:01:03,360 --> 00:01:14,300
Technology under Soli Deo Gloria means building systems that enhance human dignity, foster institutional trust, and honor our creator through righteous stewardship.

